                                        </task>
                                        </exercise>
                                        <exercise>
                                                <statement>
 <p> <term>(Extension)</term> Re-solve the problem with Elvis' running speed, <m>r</m>, and swimming speed, <m>s</m>, as parameters.  </p> 
                                                </statement>
                                        </exercise>
                                        <exercise>
                                                <statement>
 <p> <term>(Extension)</term> Have Elvis start some distance <m>I</m> away from the shore, create a model, and solve.  Verify that the previous situation is a limiting situation for when <m> I </m> approaches zero.  </p> 

                                                </statement>
        </exercise>
</worksheet>
